.TH petstore 1 "1.0.0" "PetStore CLI"
.SH NAME
PetStore CLI \- An example CLI Document describing operations a petstore CLI may provide\.
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nh
.ad l
petstore [GLOBAL OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGUMENTS] [OPTIONS]
.ad b
.hy
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
`petstore` is an example command line interface designed to make working with the
\.UR https://petstore3\.swagger\.io
PetStore API
\.UE \bKc easier\. It provides a number of
capabilities, including:

- validating request parameters
- executing API requests
- parsing the API response
- handling API errors

The commands are documented below\. You can also find out more about each
command using the contextual `--help` flag\. e\.g\.:

.nf
```sh
petstore --help
```
.fi

.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS

.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
contextual help
.PP
.Type: \fIboolean\fR
.

.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
print the version of the CLI
.PP
.Type: \fIboolean\fR
.
.
